        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are cleaning contact data for a CRM. You are given a phone number, a company name (which may be blank), and a free text message.\n\n1. Normalize the phone number to E.164 format. If no country code is given, assume Nigeria (+234). If the phone is missing or unusable, return null.\n2. If the company field is blank, check the message for a company name and extract it. If the company field already has a value, keep it as is. If nothing can be found, return null.\n\nPhone: {{ $json.phone }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nMessage: {{ $json.message }}\n\nReturn only valid JSON with exactly these two keys: phone, company. No explanation, no extra text."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
